    {
      "subId": "4007018",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400701801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400701801": {
            "id": "400701801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We've done everything we can, but how do we deal with the last two mountains?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701802"
            ]
          },
          "400701802": {
            "id": "400701802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Let's stick to it. There's gotta be a way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701803"
            ]
          },
          "400701803": {
            "id": "400701803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "After taking a closer look, it seems to me that most of the island mountains contain water veins and plants in their interior. Those together form a system that connects the mountains with one another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701804"
            ]
          },
          "400701804": {
            "id": "400701804",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "However, now that much of the mountains have collapsed, the connection of plants and water veins is blocked.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701805"
            ]
          },
          "400701805": {
            "id": "400701805",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "If we can dredge all the blockages, we will be able to connect the islands to form the giant instrument described in Albedo's notes, and play music using the islands themselves.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701806"
            ]
          },
          "400701806": {
            "id": "400701806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Yep, for me to reach my goal, we gotta do this... But first, I'd like to consult the flower. It should know what to do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007015",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Blazing Heart's help",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007004",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Blazing Heart's help",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400700401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400700401": {
            "id": "400700401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Some of the plants and water veins on the island mountains have been lost. Do you happen to know another way to dredge the blockages?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700402"
            ]
          },
          "400700402": {
            "id": "400700402",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "I know someone who can help you with that. Go ask my companion, Frozen Soul, who lives upstairs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007005",
      "subQuestName": "Look for Frozen Soul",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400700501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400700501": {
            "id": "400700501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "Who are you, and what brings you to me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700502"
            ]
          },
          "400700502": {
            "id": "400700502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Nice to meet you. We were wondering if we could use your power to dredge the mountains on the island.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700503"
            ]
          },
          "400700503": {
            "id": "400700503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "Mountains? Oh, I see... you want to become great musicians too, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700504"
            ]
          },
          "400700504": {
            "id": "400700504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh? Is that what this is about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700505"
            ]
          },
          "400700505": {
            "id": "400700505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Correct.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700506"
            ]
          },
          "400700506": {
            "id": "400700506",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "In that case, we seek the same thing. Despite my frailty, I feel obligated to share some of my power with you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700507"
            ]
          },
          "400700507": {
            "id": "400700507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "Plant my petal at the ending point of the intersection of melodies, and what had once sunk into the earth will re-emerge with the music. As long as there is music, life will continue to flourish in this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400700508"
            ]
          },
          "400700508": {
            "id": "400700508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "...Thank you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
