    {
      "subId": "4007019",
      "subQuestName": "Inform Frozen Soul of the result",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400701901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400701901": {
            "id": "400701901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Can you feel anything, now that we've planted the petal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701902"
            ]
          },
          "400701902": {
            "id": "400701902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "Yes, I can feel it. The sun is shining brightly, the sea gleams like a gemstone, the waves lap the milky-white beaches, and the grains of sand are pulled into the sea, then pushed back ashore...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701903"
            ]
          },
          "400701903": {
            "id": "400701903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "...the seabirds are landing on the rocks, pecking gently and making rhythmic sounds. ♪ dum-dum, dum-dum ♪...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701904"
            ]
          },
          "400701904": {
            "id": "400701904",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "It's music.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701905"
            ]
          },
          "400701905": {
            "id": "400701905",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Frozen Soul",
            "text": "This is indeed music. In fact, this whole island is a giant musical instrument. Since you are a musician, you should be able to understand the meaning behind its original creation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701906"
            ]
          },
          "400701906": {
            "id": "400701906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Making music with the tides, waves, and sea breeze as your instruments is the most romantic thing in the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701907"
            ]
          },
          "400701907": {
            "id": "400701907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Let's go, everyone. It's time for my performance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007010",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the hill where the wind blows",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400701001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400701001": {
            "id": "400701001",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701002"
            ]
          },
          "400701002": {
            "id": "400701002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Finally, the time has come.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701003"
            ]
          },
          "400701003": {
            "id": "400701003",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Everyone, I once made a wish to perform with someone no one could have expected. And today, on this island, I've found my answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701004"
            ]
          },
          "400701004": {
            "id": "400701004",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "No one knows the name or appearance of the man who transformed this island into a giant musical instrument so many years ago, but he is unquestionably one of Teyvat's greatest musicians.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701005"
            ]
          },
          "400701005": {
            "id": "400701005",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "I never imagined I'd be able to see such an instrument, and I never imagined we'd be able to play it during a high tide.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701006"
            ]
          },
          "400701006": {
            "id": "400701006",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you going to play some rock 'n' roll?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701007"
            ]
          },
          "400701007": {
            "id": "400701007",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "No.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701008"
            ]
          },
          "400701008": {
            "id": "400701008",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Music is the gift one gives to their kindred spirit, so... I'll play something that makes for a better duet with the original musician.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701009"
            ]
          },
          "400701009": {
            "id": "400701009",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "No rock music for today. Instead, I'm gonna show you something new!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701010"
            ]
          },
          "400701010": {
            "id": "400701010",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "...Phew.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701011"
            ]
          },
          "400701011": {
            "id": "400701011",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "How was it? Not bad, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701012"
            ]
          },
          "400701012": {
            "id": "400701012",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Quite impressive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701013"
            ]
          },
          "400701013": {
            "id": "400701013",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "I've never heard a duet like that before. It was very interesting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701014"
            ]
          },
          "400701014": {
            "id": "400701014",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And so elegant as well! Paimon's not sure how best to put it... But it was just super unique.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701017"
            ]
          },
          "400701017": {
            "id": "400701017",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Hehe, thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701018"
            ]
          },
          "400701018": {
            "id": "400701018",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "And now I can say my wish has come true.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701019"
            ]
          },
          "400701019": {
            "id": "400701019",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Is there anything else you'd like to do?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701020"
            ]
          },
          "400701020": {
            "id": "400701020",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "No, in fact, I reckon I'll get a good night's sleep tonight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701021"
            ]
          },
          "400701021": {
            "id": "400701021",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Does this mean everyone is free for the time being? If so, I have a suggestion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701022"
            ]
          },
          "400701022": {
            "id": "400701022",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "I'd like to return to the Fatui camp, and see what's going on there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701023"
            ]
          },
          "400701023": {
            "id": "400701023",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Oh? So you've discovered the Fatui camp as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701024"
            ]
          },
          "400701024": {
            "id": "400701024",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Wait, you know about it too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701025"
            ]
          },
          "400701025": {
            "id": "400701025",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Of course, I'm a genius astrologist. Didn't I mention that my scryglass has recovered a little? I can sense what's going on here through divination.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701026"
            ]
          },
          "400701026": {
            "id": "400701026",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Uh, I didn't know the Fatui were here too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701027"
            ]
          },
          "400701027": {
            "id": "400701027",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Indeed. I also informed Fischl of this when we parted ways today. If she runs into them, she'll stay hidden and out of danger.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701028"
            ]
          },
          "400701028": {
            "id": "400701028",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "I see, then perhaps we should tell everyone what we know.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701029"
            ]
          },
          "400701029": {
            "id": "400701029",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You tell everyone about the Fatui camp and the strange machine you found on the day you arrived...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701030"
            ]
          },
          "400701030": {
            "id": "400701030",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "A strange machine, and delirious Fatui...? Are you suggesting these are connected to the mirage?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701031"
            ]
          },
          "400701031": {
            "id": "400701031",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "I can't say I'm certain, but I don't believe they are completely unrelated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701032"
            ]
          },
          "400701032": {
            "id": "400701032",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Fair enough. Let's go check out the camp."
          }
        }
      }
    },
