    {
      "subId": "4007016",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the Fatui bastion",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400701601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400701601": {
            "id": "400701601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's strange that on our way here, we've only run into local monsters, and no Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701602"
            ]
          },
          "400701602": {
            "id": "400701602",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "How bizarre... there are still signs of the camp, and the machine is still here, but all the people have vanished.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701603"
            ]
          },
          "400701603": {
            "id": "400701603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(This machine must have something to do with the mirages. Sure, it's broken, but maybe that itself is the cause.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701604"
            ]
          },
          "400701604": {
            "id": "400701604",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(...But if the machine can cause people to hallucinate, why did they vanish? Is there anything else going on?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701605"
            ]
          },
          "400701605": {
            "id": "400701605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(Did they disappear, or are they hiding from us?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701606"
            ]
          },
          "400701606": {
            "id": "400701606",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I give up — I'm just going to divine the answer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701607"
            ]
          },
          "400701607": {
            "id": "400701607",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701608"
            ]
          },
          "400701608": {
            "id": "400701608",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "What's this...? Some kind of energy flow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701609"
            ]
          },
          "400701609": {
            "id": "400701609",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Sorry, everyone, I can't seem to find any trace of the Fatui. My scryglass has gotten hazy again, but this time, I can sense some sort of energy converging and taking physical form.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701610"
            ]
          },
          "400701610": {
            "id": "400701610",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "The destination is... the island over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701611"
            ]
          },
          "400701611": {
            "id": "400701611",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Whose mirage will it be this time?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701612"
            ]
          },
          "400701612": {
            "id": "400701612",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Hmm... let's head over and have a look. Maybe we'll be able to find something there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4007017",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the island that Mona mentioned",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400701701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400701701": {
            "id": "400701701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Here we are.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701702"
            ]
          },
          "400701702": {
            "id": "400701702",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Huh? Fischl?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701703"
            ]
          },
          "400701703": {
            "id": "400701703",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701704"
            ]
          },
          "400701704": {
            "id": "400701704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's really her! Hey, Fischl—!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701705"
            ]
          },
          "400701705": {
            "id": "400701705",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "...Hmph, my imprudent retainers, you've finally arrived.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701706"
            ]
          },
          "400701706": {
            "id": "400701706",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "O—Oh my, long time no see!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701707"
            ]
          },
          "400701707": {
            "id": "400701707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "It hasn't been that long, has it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701708"
            ]
          },
          "400701708": {
            "id": "400701708",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Ahem... Mein Fräulein and I sensed a peculiar aura, and came here ahead of time to reunite with everyone. We weren't expecting you... Well, what I mean to say is, you arrived sooner than we expected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701709"
            ]
          },
          "400701709": {
            "id": "400701709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is it just Paimon, or does Oz seem nervous?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701710"
            ]
          },
          "400701710": {
            "id": "400701710",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "The advent of the Immernachtreich is imminent, and I still need to prepare for the consecration.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701711"
            ]
          },
          "400701711": {
            "id": "400701711",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Mein Fräulein, are you sure you—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701712"
            ]
          },
          "400701712": {
            "id": "400701712",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "I am quite capable of acting on my own, Oz. If you're weary of the encroaching darkness of the night, you're quite welcome to return to the blinding brightness of the day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701713"
            ]
          },
          "400701713": {
            "id": "400701713",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Please, mein Fräulein, do not say such things. I am your loyal attendant, your eyes, and I will never leave your side.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701714"
            ]
          },
          "400701714": {
            "id": "400701714",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Fischl",
            "text": "...Stop staring at me like that! A—Anyway, the time of explanation... is not yet upon us, hmph!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701715"
            ]
          },
          "400701715": {
            "id": "400701715",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "Oh, mein Fräulein!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701716"
            ]
          },
          "400701716": {
            "id": "400701716",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "I do apologize, everyone. Mein Fräulein is having a rough day — please do not take it to heart. I must also excuse myself now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701717"
            ]
          },
          "400701717": {
            "id": "400701717",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "...Huh, still no improvement in her mood, even after all this time away from the group.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701718"
            ]
          },
          "400701718": {
            "id": "400701718",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "As soon as I saw Fischl, I realized that the mirage that's about to take shape here must have something to do with her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701719"
            ]
          },
          "400701719": {
            "id": "400701719",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Yes. I, at least, felt a peculiar sense of familiarity when I approached my mirage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701720"
            ]
          },
          "400701720": {
            "id": "400701720",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Me too. Even though it didn't really make sense, I just had a feeling that something exciting was gonna happen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701721"
            ]
          },
          "400701721": {
            "id": "400701721",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Exactly, if Fischl and Oz can also sense something, then our suspicions are likely to be right on the Mora... Fischl's probably agitated because she doesn't want to confront her mirage.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701722"
            ]
          },
          "400701722": {
            "id": "400701722",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How come?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701723"
            ]
          },
          "400701723": {
            "id": "400701723",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Maybe her mirage conceals some secrets that she doesn't want anyone to know about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400701724"
            ]
          },
          "400701724": {
            "id": "400701724",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Let's all take a rest here for now. When the mirage appears, we will get to the bottom of this mystery."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}